Ambient TV: pass color-standard/-transfer/-range and CTA-861.3 hdr-static-info to MediaCodec
at configure (as Kodi's CDVDVideoCodecAndroidMediaCodec does). Option color_info=0 disables it.

diff --git a/libavcodec/mediacodecdec.c b/libavcodec/mediacodecdec.c
